msgid "Mounting the buzzer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:67
#: b7636c0fbef34fb6b0624a3aec0eb7c8
msgid "The sound from the buzzer can impact the accelerometers if placed too close to the autopilot which can lead to poor altitude hold performance when the buzzer is activated. The buzzer should ideally be mounted at least 5cm away from the autopilot and the speaker (i.e. the open hole) should not be pointing directly at the autopilot."
msgstr ""

